    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Fate sphere, Life sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use a Life sphere ability on an ally, they receive a +1 luck bonus to all attack rolls, saving throws, skill checks and ability checks until the end of their next turn. This bonus increases by +1 for every 5 Life caster levels you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/fate#toc109\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
